SUMMARY:NCS 24th Annual Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The Neurocritical Care Society holds its 24th annual meeting 
 in Seattle\, Washington\, for physicians\, nurses\, advanced practice pr
 oviders\, pharmacists and trainees in neurocritical care. The program in
 cludes late breaking science and research abstract presentations under t
 he theme Reaching New Heights.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission: 2026-0
 5-03\nAbstract notification: 2026-06-01 (estimated)\nAbstract withdrawal
  deadline (if accepted elsewhere): 2026-07-17\nEarly registration: 2026-
 08-05\nDiscounted housing deadline: 2026-09-21\n\nhttps://www.neurocriti
 calcare.org/Events/Annual-Meeting/Future-Annual-Meetings
LOCATION:Seattle\, Washington\, Seattle Convention Center
URL:https://www.neurocriticalcare.org/Events/Annual-Meeting/Future-Annual
 -Meetings
